{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/WAS와 Servlet/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"ce176831-2da9-5cc0-a6b1-e2cbcfe4f0a0","excerpt":"📌 WAS(Web Application Server) ✅ Servlet을 실행하고 관리하는 서버 (Servlet 컨테이너 역할) ✅ HTTP 요청을 처리하고, Servlet을 통해 동적인 웹 페이지를 생성하여 클라이언트에게 응답 ✅ 대표적인 WAS: Apache Tomcat   배경 🔹 기존 솔루션의 한계 과거에는 단순한 HTML, CSS, 이미지 등의 …","html":"<h2 id=\"-WASWeb-Application-Server\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-WASWeb-Application-Server\" aria-label=\" WASWeb Application Server permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 WAS(Web Application Server)</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ Servlet을 실행하고 관리하는 서버 (Servlet 컨테이너 역할)<br>\n✅ HTTP 요청을 처리하고, Servlet을 통해 동적인 웹 페이지를 생성하여 클라이언트에게 응답<br>\n✅ 대표적인 WAS: <strong>Apache Tomcat</strong>  </p>\n<h3 id=\"배경\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B0%B0%EA%B2%BD\" aria-label=\"배경 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>배경</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>🔹 기존 솔루션의 한계</strong><br>\n과거에는 단순한 HTML, CSS, 이미지 등의 정적 파일을 제공하는 웹 서버(Apache, Nginx) 만 존재했다.<br>\n웹이 발전함에 따라 <strong>사용자의 요청에 따른 동적인 처리</strong>가 필요해졌다.</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 기존 솔루션의 한계 해결</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>WAS = 웹 서버 + 웹 컨테이너</li>\n<li>정적 컨텐츠는 웹 서버가 제공하고, 동적 컨텐츠는 웹 컨테이너가 제공</li>\n<li>웹 컨테이너는 서블릿을 실행하고 관리</li>\n<li>웹 컨테이너에서 <strong>동적인 데이터를 처리하는 역할을 하는 것이 서블릿</strong>  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/45416/WAS.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 34.705882352941174%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='WAS' title='' src='/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/ca1dc/WAS.png' srcset='/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/e7570/WAS.png 170w,\n/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/f46e7/WAS.png 340w,\n/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/ca1dc/WAS.png 680w,\n/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/02d09/WAS.png 1020w,\n/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/9d567/WAS.png 1360w,\n/static/0ba25d4333aadc51f8839eccf7d15b3f/45416/WAS.png 2080w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"동작-흐름\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8F%99%EC%9E%91-%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%84\" aria-label=\"동작 흐름 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>동작 흐름</strong></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>클라이언트 → HTTP 요청 (GET /hello)</li>\n<li>WAS → 요청을 받아 Servlet 실행 (HelloServlet)</li>\n<li>Servlet → 동적 응답을 생성하여 응답 (Hello, Servlet!)</li>\n<li>WAS → 클라이언트에게 최종 응답 전달</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"-Servlet\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Servlet\" aria-label=\" Servlet permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Servlet</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ HTTP 요청을 받아 동적인 처리를 수행하고, HTML 또는 JSON 등의 응답을 생성<br>\n✅ 대표적인 Servlet: <strong>DispatcherServlet</strong>  </p>\n<h3 id=\"동작-흐름-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8F%99%EC%9E%91-%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%84-1\" aria-label=\"동작 흐름 1 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>동작 흐름</strong></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>클라이언트 요청을 받아 동적 데이터 생성</p>\n<ul>\n<li>비즈니스 로직, 외부 시스템과 연동 등</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>동적인 HTML 또는 JSON을 생성하여 클라이언트에게 반환</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"라이프사이클-메서드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%ED%94%84%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%B4-%EB%A9%94%EC%84%9C%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"라이프사이클 메서드 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>라이프사이클 메서드</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>🔹 init()</strong><br>\nServlet이 처음 생성될 때 한 번 실행 (초기화 작업 수행)</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 service()</strong><br>\nHTTP 요청이 들어올 때마다 실행 (요청 처리)</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 destroy()</strong><br>\nServlet이 제거될 때 한 번 실행 (자원 해제)</p>\n<h2 id=\"-Spring-MVC\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Spring-MVC\" aria-label=\" Spring MVC permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Spring MVC</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ <strong>WAS 내에서 서블릿을 기반으로 동작하는 웹 프레임워크</strong><br>\n✅  <code class=\"language-text\">DispatcherServlet</code>이라는 서블릿을 기반으로 동작  </p>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/web/webmvc.html\">https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/web/webmvc.html</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_vBAbjj4Pk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_vBAbjj4Pk</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"WAS와 Servlet","date":"February 21, 2025","update":"February 21, 2025","tags":["spring"],"series":"Spring 기초 이해"},"fields":{"slug":"/WAS와 Servlet/","readingTime":{"minutes":2.525}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"ce176831-2da9-5cc0-a6b1-e2cbcfe4f0a0","fields":{"slug":"/WAS와 Servlet/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"WAS와 Servlet"}}},{"node":{"id":"7eedce63-46d2-5594-8da2-2be92a40f2e6","fields":{"slug":"/DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정"}}},{"node":{"id":"5f1a2e65-bd7b-5447-9d1d-8cf9d88a7d21","fields":{"slug":"/IoC Container/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"IoC Container"}}},{"node":{"id":"0805ba38-d23a-51c5-8cd0-a24b00a07145","fields":{"slug":"/Spring Filter & Interceptor/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Filter & Interceptor"}}},{"node":{"id":"a34f7e04-a092-5e68-8da5-5d4f8a6bf33b","fields":{"slug":"/Spring 예외 처리/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring 예외 처리"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/Service Discovery/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Service Discovery"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"ce176831-2da9-5cc0-a6b1-e2cbcfe4f0a0","series":"Spring 기초 이해","previousPostId":"02980405-73f4-5e3a-8c0f-28c830111350","nextPostId":"7eedce63-46d2-5594-8da2-2be92a40f2e6"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}